## JSON attributes

### revisions_json

A JSON array of the runbook's revisions, newest first. It is built by the provider, not protobuf JSON, so every field is present and numbers are JSON numbers.

| Field | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | string | Revision UUID. |
| `runbook_id` | string | Runbook UUID. |
| `revision_number` | number | Revision number, increasing from 1. |
| `title` | string | Title at that revision. |
| `owner_user_id`, `owner_team_id` | string | The owner at that revision. The unused one is `""`. |
| `markdown` | string | Markdown as stored. |
| `rendered_html` | string | Sanitized HTML the server rendered. |
| `content_hash` | string | Hash of the revision content. |
| `change_reason` | string | Why the revision was made. |
| `created_by` | string | Who made it. |
| `created_at` | string | RFC 3339 timestamp in UTC, or `""` when the server returned none. |
